      <li><a href="https://economicgraph.linkedin.com/content/dam/me/business/en-us/talent-solutions/resources/pdfs/the-skills-signal-report-2025.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn, Skills Signal Report 2025</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://www.weforum.org/publications/the-future-of-jobs-report-2025/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">World Economic Forum, Future of Jobs Report 2025</a></li>
